    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what if there's nothing to change? like, it's not just a bad phase, it's just who i am. i've tried every small step, every little thing people suggest, and i always end up right back here. it feels so pointless to even keep trying when the outcome is always the same. it's just endless pain.",
